{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114410","id":3133543682,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc66xhUC","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114410","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114410.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114410.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114410","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114410/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114410/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114410/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/2c29a37840514f686b220123ea9d0fdd9dd12976","number":114410,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix importing projects with PNG assets freezes Web Editor","user":{"login":"ej-sanmartin","id":29460583,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NDYwNTgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29460583?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin","html_url":"https://github.com/ej-sanmartin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #112072\r\n\r\n## Root Cause\r\n\r\nThe Godot Web Editor uses busy-wait loops on the main thread for threaded file scanning and asset importing. On web platforms, blocking the main thread prevents the browser's JavaScript event loop from running, causing the page to appear frozen, even when worker threads are successfully completing their tasks.\r\n\r\n## Fix\r\n\r\nDisable threaded operations in `EditorFileSystem` on the Web platform, for scanning and importing. This forces all file system operations to run synchronously on the main thread, avoiding the busy-wait patterns that block the browser. Trade-off is slower scanning/importing, but the editor remains responsive.\r\n\r\nEDIT: slowness is prominent on startup of the editor, but after it becomes responsive, again.\r\n\r\n## Demo\r\n\r\nBuilt on `macOS 15.7.1` with 1.4 GHz Quad-Core Intel Core i5 and Intel Iris Plus Graphics 645 1536 MB. On `Edge` web browser.\r\n\r\nAlso, using MRP from #112072\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cd619aa3-fdbe-43e0-a027-bb22fc8f26e6\r\n\r\n> During build I get the following `warning`:\r\n> ```\r\n> em++: warning: -pthread + ALLOW_MEMORY_GROWTH may run non-wasm code slowly, see\r\n> https://github.com/WebAssembly/design/issues/1271 [-Wpthreads-mem-growth]\r\n> warning: user library symbol '$GodotWebXR' depends on internal symbol '$MainLoop'\r\n> ```\r\n> which can explan slowness in this and official builds.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097455,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc0NTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:web","name":"platform:web","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels